  "slug": "one-of-my-afternoons",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/4726_one-of-my-afternoons.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "I wanted to go see a movie this afternoon, but there were no good movies. I called my good friend and wanted to go exercise with her, but she said she was not feeling well today and we had to go to the mall to buy things. We saw a beautiful skirt. She liked white and I liked black, but the black skirt was a bit expensive, so I bought two white ones, one for myself and one for her."
  ],
  "english_full": "I wanted to go see a movie this afternoon, but there were no good movies. I called my good friend and wanted to go exercise with her, but she said she was not feeling well today and we had to go to the mall to buy things. We saw a beautiful skirt. She liked white and I liked black, but the black skirt was a bit expensive, so I bought two white ones, one for myself and one for her.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Я жела́л посмотреть фильм пополудни, но хоро́ших фильмов не было. Я позвонил своему хоро́шему другу и хотел пойти с ней на трениро́вку, но она ска́зала, что сего́дня не чувству́ет себя хоро́шо, и нам нужно пойти в торго́вый центр, чтобы купить не́что. Мы увидели краси́вую ю́бку. Ей понравилась бе́лая, а мне понра́вилась чёрная, но чёрная ю́бка была до́рога́я, поэ́тому я ку́пил две бе́лые: одну для себя́ и одну для неё."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Ya zhelál posmotret' film popoludni, no khoróshikh filmov ne bylo. Ya pozvoníl svoemu khoróshému druz'yu i khotel poyti s ney na treniróvku, no ona skazála, chto segodnya ne chuvstvúet sebya khorósho, i nam nuzhno poyti v torgový tsentr, chtoby kupit' néchto. My uvideli krasivuyu yúbku. Ey ponravilas' bélaya, a mne ponravilas' chernaya, no chernaya yúbka byla dórogaya, poé temu ya kupil dve bélye: odnu dlya sebyá i odnu dlya neyo."
  ],
